  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than three years from 16/04/2025. \r\nReason: In order to comply with Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, as amended by Section 51 of the Planning and Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: [06- 2023/1PP/401 and Fire safety strategy, Received: 09/01/2025; 06- 2023/1PP/210/Rev C and 06-2023/1PP/211/Rev C. Received: 07/04/2025; 06-2023/1PP/100, 06-2023/1PP/101, 06-2023/1PP/102, 06-2023/1PP/103, 06-2023/1PP/104 Existing - section aa, 06-2023/1PP/104 Existing - section bb, 06-2023/1PP/106, 06-2023/1PP/107, 06-2023/1PP/108, 06-2023/1PP/109, 06-2023/1PP/110, 06-2023/1PP/400, P01, P02, P03, P04, P05, P06, P07 and Design Statement. Received: 19/05/2026]. \r\nReason: In order to ensure the development is carried out in accordance with the planning permission.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building, unless otherwise shown on the approved plans.\r\nReason: In order to safeguard the appearance of the area.",
    "Condition : 4 - The windows to be fitted on the roof face of the dwelling shall be black-framed and traditional, conservation-style.\r\nReason: In order to safeguard the architectural and historic interest of the conservation area.",
    "Condition : 5 - The windows formed in the [insert] elevation shall be obscure-glazed and non-opening below 1.7 metres above internal floor level. The windows shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than in accordance with the requirements of this condition. \r\nReason: In order to protect neighbours' privacy\r\n"
